{"version":1,"content":"<p>演而優則唱的藝人鍾嘉欣近年積極舉行巡唱，早前她宣布喜訊，將於明年3月6日假紅館舉行《A WALK TO REMEMBER》世界巡迴演唱會香港站，是她相隔14年第二次在港開個唱，更是首度登上紅館舞台，意義重大！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:21:01.012934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_hash":"c1b1f48c87356cbf07ae01f71bdce20a18e2c3f2cff3ae4c5ccf6e76e558c339","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}